  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support implementation of GIZ NAMA TTR Phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The GIZ has been mandated by the Decision No. 38 dated March 30, 2022 of the NAMA Facility Board to appraise the NAMA Support Project Outline of the Recipient selected by that Decision as NAMA Support Project of the 6th Call of the NAMA Facility. The project aims to jump-start a large-scale thermo-technical retrofitting (TTR) program and create the market conditions to scale up investments in energy efficiency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective of the project is to support implementation phase 1 of the NSP Energy Performance Contracting for Residential Retrofitting in Ulaanbaatar City. This will aim to address the technical, operational and financial barriers to retrofit the residential building stock in Ulaanbaatar and enable a broader transformation of residential building energy efficiency in Mongolia.</narrative>
  </description>
